OL,3,ATemperatures could peak at 26C as
OL,4,Asummerlike warmth returns next week
OL,5,
OL,6,FTemperatures could peak at 26C next
OL,7,Fweek as late summer warmth returns to
OL,8,Fparts of the UK.
OL,10,FSouthern areas will experience the
OL,11,Fhighest temperatures, but most
OL,12,Flocations will be warmer than normal
OL,13,Ffor late September.
OL,15,FWarmth could last all week for some in
OL,16,FEngland and Wales, but it might only be
OL,17,Fa short-lived boost for Scotland and
OL,18,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
