OL,3,ATemperatures could peak at 26C as
OL,4,Asummerlike warmth returns next week
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe high pressure, which is responsible
OL,7,Ffor the warmth, will also mean little
OL,8,Frain for places continuing to
OL,9,Fexperience drought conditions.
